On Sun, 13 Aug 2006, Topi Linkala wrote:

> Have you ever heard about amulets versus poison, rings of poison
> resistance, green dragon scales and green dragon scale mails? Who wears
> these on ascension?

I. If I get an early wish with a non-poison resistant character, I take
Green DSM and mostly do not bother to switch later on. If I remember
correctly, I have 3 ascensions with Grey/Silver DSM and 4 with differently
coloured DSM (Green or whatever dragon first left scales).

Using the armour slot for an intrinsic gainable by eating removes one
possible slot for magic resistance and reflection, but there are still
choices to be made (Cloak of MR/Magicbane/various Quest artifacts, Amulet
of R/Shield of R/Longbow of Diana).

